      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Hello my dear friend! I''ve already been waiting for you. I decided to
    get in shape to lose weight and gain strength for tough challenges, to be the
    strongest in the jungle.

    Control:

    Swipe down - roll up

    Swipe up
    - jump

    Piles to the left - move left

    Pile to the right - move to the
    right

    Collect stars to get more popularity. Collect food to stay healthy.
    Collect dumbbells to break more stones at the end. But be careful, you will face
    a difficult test in the form of random obstacles'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 98508cd4e9ea24e7eaf7d65db9c67283, type: 2}
